## 1. Promoted theorem

Let `F=(f,g): A^2_C -> A^2_C` be a non-invertible Keller map. Let

```text
C(f,g) proper-subfield K proper-subfield C(x,y),
d1=[C(x,y):K] >= 2,       d2=[K:C(f,g)] >= 2,
